                                "text": "the radiant sun"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f639b6d-1a22-4966-815c-4f5193fc4801",
                                "sense_id": "61af7fce-7cd8-36d9-bab7-cdb5d9a9cd0e",
                                "text": "They in ranks / Sat all, where ſtood the fiery ſteeds of each, / And where his radiant arms lay on the field."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2958f824-2dfd-33bf-ad31-3e57a41160a2",
                        "entry_id": "56f963e0-0180-3af7-9693-3a4f31221a46",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Emitted as radiation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "903da255-f5de-375a-94b7-4d199975c324",
                        "entry_id": "56f963e0-0180-3af7-9693-3a4f31221a46",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Beaming with vivacity and happiness."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "77322af4-bdee-41c8-ba0f-fc8b02458a22",
                                "sense_id": "903da255-f5de-375a-94b7-4d199975c324",
                                "text": "a radiant face"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fd00b63f-1e5a-4752-9b14-08590eda3598",
                                "sense_id": "903da255-f5de-375a-94b7-4d199975c324",
                                "text": "His sister, Mrs. Gerard, stood there in carriage gown and sables, radiant with surprise. ¶ “Phil ! You ! Exactly like you, Philip, to come strolling in from the antipodes—dear fellow !” recovering from the fraternal embrace and holding both lapels of his coat in her gloved hands."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b1afbfa-26f8-43f7-9735-9075e81daff8",
                                "sense_id": "903da255-f5de-375a-94b7-4d199975c324",
                                "text": "Nurse Cramer had a cute nose and a radiant, blooming complexion dotted with fetching sprays of adorable freckles that Yossarian detested."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b9dcce4a-776f-369d-b170-c5e679e34103",
                        "entry_id": "56f963e0-0180-3af7-9693-3a4f31221a46",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Strikingly beautiful."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bdc19961-6cb7-46bb-997a-5fbd65f53ebd",
                                "sense_id": "b9dcce4a-776f-369d-b170-c5e679e34103",
                                "text": "And yet she was ensnaringly beautiful, despite her pride and self-consciousness; radiant and certain of conquest she stood before the man who alone seemed to have neither eye nor ear for charms that had never elsewhere played her false."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
